'''Hoop Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Attack on Titanium (Insane)|Attack on Titanium]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] greatly increases freeze chance and duration, range, and health. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it can be unlocked when beating [[Gorigori (Cats of the Cosmos)|Gorigori]].

